sequenceDiagram
    participant S as Subscriber
    participant B as MQTT broker
    participant P as Publisher
    S->>B: SUBSCRIBE tutorials/device-1/temperature<br/>QoS 1
    B-->>S: SUBACK success
    P->>B: PUBLISH tutorials/device-1/temperature<br/>temperature_c=23, QoS 1
    B-->>P: PUBACK (transport acknowledgement)
    B-->>S: PUBLISH tutorials/device-1/temperature
    S-->>B: PUBACK
    Note over S,P: PUBACK does not confirm application processing
